      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/9d8465/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-01T20:47:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I noticed after our first game with Miss Info that she has no hit points showing on the set-up side of her card. Does this mean she is immune to damage until flipped then? I didn't notice any text to that effect and we were using the i-pad to keep track of hit points with the sentinel's app. Is there an official ruling about damage to her before she flips?</p>",
