      "raw": "<p>It&#39;s not exactly that she&#39;s invulnerable, it&#39;s that she&#39;s not even a valid target. You can&#39;t even play things like Chrono Ranger&#39;s bounties on her, because she&#39;s not a target.</p><p>The whole point of MI, is that you&#39;re finding clues about who&#39;s messing with you. It&#39;s only once you have enough clues that she is revealed and you can fight her directly.</p>",
